# Cua Driver as Arslan Hands builds it (Hands v2, spec docs/specs/2026-10-08-0157-hands-v2.md §3.6).
# Our fork's branch = upstream tag + vendored crates (aarch64-apple-darwin) + "no network"
# (telemetry, update check, skill downloads, self-update compiled out) + two lock bumps for
# advisories; ARSLAN-FORK.md in the fork says exactly what. build_hands.sh refuses any checkout
# whose HEAD is not COMMIT, and builds it offline from WORKSPACE. Moving the pin: monthly sync
# (ARSLAN-FORK.md), then a build from a clean fetch, cargo-deny with packaging/hands/cua-deny.toml,
# and the Hands harness on a Mac.
